@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Public application metadata
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/system/info
Accept: application/json

### Process liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### PostgreSQL and RabbitMQ readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### API contract (Development only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json

### Unknown endpoint returns Problem Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/unknown
Accept: application/problem+json

### Obtain CSRF protection; retain its cookie and copy the token below
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/csrf

### Recovery request (same response for unknown or throttled accounts)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{ "email": "resident@example.test" }

### Reset with a link from Mailpit; GET alone never changes the password
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{ "linkId": "{{linkId}}", "token": "{{recoveryToken}}", "newPassword": "Replacement1!" }

### Confirmed session required; use the version from GET /api/account
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/account/display-name
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{ "displayName": "Resident2", "version": 2 }

### All sessions are revoked after a successful change
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/account/change-password
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{ "currentPassword": "Current1!", "newPassword": "Replacement1!", "version": 3 }

### Administrator account search; confirmed Administrator session required
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/accounts?query=resident&role=Author&page=1&pageSize=20

### Account details and version
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/accounts/{{accountId}}

### Grant/revoke staff roles; RegularUser is always retained
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/accounts/{{accountId}}/roles
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{ "roles": ["Author", "Editor"], "version": 2 }

### Retained role audit history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/accounts/{{accountId}}/role-history?page=1&pageSize=20

### Sanitized delivery metadata
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/email-deliveries?state=Failed&page=1&pageSize=20

### Replay a still-valid failed delivery at its current version
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/email-deliveries/{{deliveryId}}/replay
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{ "version": 3 }
